  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Who We Are </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; color: black; background: white;\">Since 2002 Urbanstar has consolidated its prestige as an important multibrand that combines the best of outdoor, streetwear, casual and sneakers, along with a variety of historic high fashion brands. Urbanstar offers a curated and exclusive selection of men's and women's collections as well as the latest in beauty and home design. The choice of international and niche brands guarantee to purchase a wide range of items, from the luxury brands of established designers in the fashion world to emerging ones. In the Urbanstar selection you will be able to discover unique styles impossible to find elsewhere: browsing our website you will find a selection of over 150 brands including MM6 Maison Margiela, Alexander Wang, Nike, Maharishi and Stussy</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Calibri Light', sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">Payment methods</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">: The payment will be made via paypal 30 days after the start of the program.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><br>&bull; Other information:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Why Join the Musthave Affiliate Program? </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"background: white; margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">We are looking for innovative websites and blogs anywhere in the world - specializing in fashion, lifestyle, beauty and design in particular - for our global affiliate program and to promote all of our products, allowing you to earn commissions. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background: white; margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">Registation is simple and free, and as a member of the program you will receive a commission every time your visitors shop on Urbanstaroma.com</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background: white; margin-right: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">The Urbanstar Affiliate Program allows all approved affiliates to start earning commissions on <strong>click-thru sales</strong> by tracking all transactions from your links and paying for related activities via click-thru purchases. Any affiliate can join the Urbanstar affiliate program provided they are a Webgains member and the terms and conditions of the program, with no account opening costs.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: black;\">As an affiliate, you will need to promote Urbanstar on your site, page or blog:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">Creating engaging quality content in line with the style and tone of voice of URBANSTAROMA.COM</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">Informing your visitors about our must-have items and collections from over 150 designers</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">By advertising our content, banners, events and links of the various categories on your site and on your social channels</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">Promoting the benefits our customers love:</span></li>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" type=\"circle\">\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">a continuously updated selection of articles from the best brands;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">or returned free of charge with no added taxes throughout Italy;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">or shipping to more than 150 countries (including Mainland China, Australia and Singapore)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li style=\"color: black; line-height: normal; background: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">By accessing our data feed and increasing the traffic on the site</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>How do you benefit from the Urbanstar program at Webgains? </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Banners:</strong> Creatives updated in line with promotions and seasonal events</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Datafeed:</strong> fully automated and updated daily</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Commission:</strong> earn 10% commission <span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; color: black; background: white;\">(excluding cancellations and returns)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Cookie Length:</strong> 30 days</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>Affiliate Approval:</strong> <span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed'; color: black; background: white;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; color: black; background: white;\">evaluated manually</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong>PPC Policy PPC Policy open:</strong> Affiliates are allowed to run paid search campaigns, bidding on the store name, brands we stock as well. Affiliates are also allowed to link directly to our site. This applies to brand name and generic keywords. <span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Affiliates can place as many as you like and we encourage you to use as many as necessary and appropriate to improve click-thrus and conversion. We have found that a creative banner along with a text link or Urbanstar logo improves effectiveness.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">The entire website and Urbanstar contents are protected by copyright. You may use images and content from our websites for the promotion of our products on your website; however, all images must be used in the sale of the product through the affiliate program and attributed to us. If a special circumstance arises that requires the use of graphics, product images or content in a manner inconsistent with the foregoing, you must contact us for written approval before using such content.</span></p>\r\n</div>",
